      "mergedPostDetails": "In VR when you join a world you can't open your radial/action menu until you open the quick menu.\nThis only seems to happen in VR, desktop is unaffected. I've also only tested this Index controllers, no idea if it happens with other controllers.\nStep to reproduce:\n1. Join a new instance in VR\n2. Try to open your action/radial menu and see that nothing happens\n3. Open the quick menu\n4. Try again to open the action/radial menu and see that it works now\n\nUpdate, this was found to be a duplicate of this post since It also exists on live, whoops: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1213-radial-menu-doesnt-open-until-the-qm-has-been-opened",
